### Testing
- `tests/` mirrors `app/`. `conftest.py` mocks all infrastructure via `AsyncMock`/`MagicMock`.
- Async tests use `pytest-asyncio` (`asyncio_mode = auto`).
- Run a single test: `uv run pytest tests/path/to/test_file.py`
- Every confirmed bug fix should land with a regression test in the same change — one that
  asserts the specific broken behavior (would have failed before the fix), not just that the
  code runs.

### Pre-commit hooks
`.pre-commit-config.yaml` enforces on every `git commit`: file hygiene, `check-merge-conflict`,
`detect-private-key`, `no-commit-to-branch: main`, `ruff` + `ruff-format`. `mypy` runs at
`stages: [manual]` locally (slow) but always in CI.
